  "story": {
    "title": "Things, my friends and I do together.",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "My friends and I love playing volleyball.",
      "Girls run a race.",
      "Anil kicks the football.",
      "Sonali eats but she spills .",
      "Sangeeta and her friends dance .",
      "Anita cried while the bird flew away.",
      "Rajnish ate after sitting down.",
      "Amit climbed while grandmother watched .",
      "Sangeeta writes and Moti jumps .",
      "Vishalti and Babita are reading . The others are standing .",
      "Ram was happy to see the postcard.",
      "Guess, what the others are doing ?"
    ],
